  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pre-lecture quiz"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-6-4-pre-1\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What information can we get from text that was written or spoken by a human?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>patterns and frequencies</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Human text can show patterns and frequencies, but it can also show sentiment and meaning.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>sentiment and meaning</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Human text can show sentiment and meaning, but it can also show patterns and frequencies.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>both of the above</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Text written or spoken by a human can be analyzed for patterns and frequencies, and for sentiment and meaning.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-6-4-pre-2\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What is sentiment analysis?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>a study of whether a family heirloom has sentimental value</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>a method of systematically identifying, extracting, quantifying, and studying affective states and subjective information</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>the ability to tell whether someone is sad or happy</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-6-4-pre-3\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What question could be answered using a dataset of hotel reviews, Python, and sentiment analysis?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>What are the most frequently used words and phrases in reviews?</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. With hotel reviews and sentiment analysis, you could find the most frequently used words and phrases in reviews.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Which resort has the best pool?</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Analyzing review text answers questions about the reviews, like which words and phrases are used most.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Is there valet parking at this hotel?</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. That is a fact about one hotel. Analyzing review text finds things like the most used words and phrases.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
